  "details": "When moving the viewpoint in a low frame that has been suffering for a long time, it is a symptom that the viewpoint movement accelerates. I found the element.\nIn the video, vertical tracking is normal, but horizontal acceleration is high.\nThere is a possibility that the operation judgment in branch side movement in 1 frame is probably multiplying.\nIt should be judged the same as the vertical direction.\n\nhttps://cdn.discordapp.com/attachments/140468471031922689/559357310464557079/2019-03-24_21-26-12.webm\n",
